ind":"announcement","title":"Breaking news! \"Hop to Bunny Restaurant!\" just got a huge overhaul!","summary":"The dev team actually made this many changes!To make it easier for every shop manager to get started, we've added some proper tutorial guidance, such as:Optimized the opening flow—new saves now automatically place the initial tables and chairs;You'll receive the first story letter right after the opening event ends, reducing the wait.Adjusted the dialogue, character performances, quest conditions, and reward distribution flow across multiple story segments to improve chapter transitions.Adjusted","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T04:03:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706693620","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188070-1838407329265772","game_id":"steam-4188070","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Little Bunny Is Getting Better!\"","summary":"Content UpdatesExpanded story emails and event conditions.Added new employee content, adjusted the hiring interface, and improved employee performance.Updated the \"Carrot and Stick\" skill effects and related interactions.Added a notification red dot system, optimized settings guidance, and improved interface adaptation.Reward display upgrades: added coin pop-up numbers and flash feedback during customer checkout, and added victory confetti effects upon task completion.Optimizations and FixesFixe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-20T15:11:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329265772","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188070-1834602721184363","game_id":"steam-4188070","kind":"update","title":"Look! An adorable update","summary":"Dear Players,Thank you for your continued support and love for Hop to Bunny Restaurant! To bring you an even richer gaming experience, we have released a version update.✨ Update Content ✨ New AdditionsMachine Animations: Beverage machines and bread makers now feature improved click animation feedback.Reward Animations: Added special effects for rewards from letters and tasks.Dialogue Sound Effects: We’ve created sound effects for story dialogues that simulate the rhythm of real speech.Several ot","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-03T09:57:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721184363","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188070-1833968530887799","game_id":"steam-4188070","kind":"update","title":"Game Update","summary":"Add: You can now open related upgrades from each different UI Add: Story customers now have touch soundsAdd: Game will automatically choose the best fit displayTweak: Auto prompt story dialogue is now off by default.Tweak: Changed UI raitos of all different UI size.Tweak: Some UI animation was not able to play.Tweak: At 1st game event the deer won't follow customer into your restaurant.Fixed: Game UI now always have thier correct ratios.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-28T11:13:57Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530887799","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4188070-1833968530885100","game_id":"steam-4188070","kind":"announcement","title":"Your desktop bunny restaurant's Demo is now live!","summary":"\"Hop to Bunny Restaurant\" Demo is now officially live! Welcome to download the Demo and give it a try!To celebrate the Demo release, we’ve unlocked three extra-special service staff members early in the current version!Special Service Staff - Bunny Miko Can dance and offer blessings for every customer in the restaurant while collecting Bunny Coins. A very worry-free employee, with impressive long-term returns after leveling up!Delivery Service Staff - Accountant Bunny Not only delivers meals but","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-27T11:10:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530885100","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:59:00Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4188070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4188070":"2026-10-26T01:48:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4188070":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4671840":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T01:48:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4188070","app_id":4188070,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:29Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"1926dc2f9b31499c36f1501a08216b61ea51d4a36a8d7a0c66ee9856dbd86cfd","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Start your desktop bakery! Begin with one cookie and a table. Decorate, cook, hire staff, and learn recipes. Serve lively bunny customers, meet quirky characters, and unlock their unique stories and dishes!","publishers":[{"name":"头猫兔工作室"}],"developers":[{"name":"猫咪猫猫人"},{"name":"Mosscat"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":t